# PHASE 0 FINAL SECURITY + ARCHITECTURE FIX REPORT

## 1. Executive Result

**PHASE 0 — NOT READY**

## 2. Critical Issues Fixed

| Issue | How fixed |
|-------|-----------|
| Conversation self-join | New RLS policy: first participant must be self on empty conv; further inserts require existing participant. Helper `is_conversation_participant()`. |
| Friend request ID rewrite | BEFORE UPDATE trigger freezes `requester_id`/`addressee_id`; status machine (pending→accepted/rejected by addressee; pending→cancelled by requester; terminal locked). |
| Message reaction without membership | INSERT policy requires message → conversation → participant = auth.uid(). |
| Message insert membership | Reinforced via `is_conversation_participant(conversation_id)`. |
| Profile privacy document-only | `can_view_profile()` implements public / friends / private (followers/hidden treat as private until product phase). |
| Rate limit not wired | Postgres `rate_limit_buckets` + `check_rate_limit` RPC; `src/services/social.js` calls RPC before mutations. |
| Config abstraction dead | Contracts + classification retained; social service is the integration path for mutations. Full index.html constant removal still partial (compat). |
| Contracts JSDoc-only | Added JSON Schema files under `contracts/schemas/`. |

